
*** create database ****

Create a database with the following specifications in pgAdmin:
NAME = planner_db
USER = postgres
PASSWORD = 1234
HOST = localhost
PORT = 5432


*** run project ***

git clone https://github.com/fa-sharif/planner_backend.git
cd planner_backend/
pipenv shell
pip install -r requirements.txt
cd planner/
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver


*** Import the Insomnia file (insomnia.har) to call the API in the project. ****

singup
login
